/// Lists your ads with their performance over a date range, including ads created directly in each platform's ads manager.  Returns a paginated list of ads with metrics computed over an optional date range. Use source=all to include externally-synced ads from platform ad managers.  If no date range is provided, it defaults to the last 90 days. The date range is capped at 730 days max.  ### History  When an ad account connects, Zernio imports its last 90 days of metrics, so the metrics hold no data for days before that.  When `accountId` or `adAccountId` resolves to a Meta ad account, a range reaching further back answers `202` with `backfillPending: true` and the covered part. The older days (up to 730 days back) are imported in the background; repeat the request until it returns 200.  A request scoped to no Meta account never returns `202`.  ### Finding the ad behind a comment  To find the Zernio ad behind a comment you see in Meta Business Manager:  1. Filter by platformAdId (the Meta ad ID), effectiveObjectStoryId (Facebook), or effectiveInstagramMediaId (Instagram). Those are the post/media the ad's engagement lives on, and are also returned on each ad's `creative` object. 2. Call GET /v1/ads/{adId}/comments with the returned ad id.
